# Optional local build-time lactate threshold (BPM). Copy to .env and fill in your value.
# .env is gitignored and must not be committed.
# Leave unset to fall back to age-based zone estimates from birthday_month,
# or to skip zone teeth when that is also missing. The site still builds.
# Production may set the GitHub Actions variable LTHR_BPM; an empty value is unset.
LTHR_BPM=
